lay mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2d pixel art puzzle exploration sections before each stage of survival, giving you information that will slowly help you find out how to defend yourself against the monsters of the night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small peak at the terrifying, character-focused, intriguing story that will slowly reveal itself to you as the game progresses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947660/extras/de60c74742d6922ed7e7f521e52c5c90.poster.avif?t=1755351449\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947660/extras/de60c74742d6922ed7e7f521e52c5c90.webm?t=1755351449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947660/extras/de60c74742d6922ed7e7f521e52c5c90.mp4?t=1755351449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you wondered what brought you here? <br>... <br>Why do you still fight back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... <br><i>Don't let your guard down. Not for a second. </i><br> <i>...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I'm proud of you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You're stronger than you think you are. </i> <br>  <br>  <br>  <br>   <br><i>Don't let <strong>him</strong> trick you.</i> </p>","developers":["StarStreak"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3753870","name":"DIAPAUSE"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947660/c502780d86f763bec780733ff7b5fd94ffb37e9e/header.jpg?t=1755351449","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257181384,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamsta